    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061122.0321\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 23 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nXinhua international news advisory -- Nov.23\n\n\n\n\nThe following are some of the major international news stories scheduled to be covered or pursued by Xinhua on Thursday.\n\n-- Hu Jintao delivers speech in India.\n\n-- Chinese president arrived in Islamabad.\n\n-- WTO chief calls for relaunch of Doah Round talks.\n\n-- Uruguay legislators ratify protocol of Mercosur Parliament.\n\n-- Argentina condemns assassination of Lebanese minister.",
